	And I log into the provisioning homepage as "test@liferay.com" with password "kwSgiajslgb7ecsD"
	And I search the accounts page using the keyword "Korlic"
	And I click on the account with the name "Korlic - ${staticProjectName}" on the provisioning index
	And I click on the "DXP Production" subscription link
	And I click on generate license button
	And I generate a new license with the following values
	| Product                | DXP Production                             | |
	| Choose Liferay Version | 7.2                                        | |
	| Type                   | Digital Enterprise Production (Production) | |
	| Choose Purchase        | ${staticProductPurchaseId1}                | |
	| Host Name              | localhost                                  | |
	| IP Addresses           | 123.456.789.012                            | |
	| MAC Addresses          | 0A-1B-2C-3D-4E-5F                          | |
